VERIFICATION
Verification is intended to assist the Chocolatey moderators and community
in verifying that this package's contents are trustworthy.

The author of Aura publishes this package. The files under tools\aura are the
contents of the Windows archive of the same Aura release, plus the one-line
file tools\aura\lib\aura\install-manager, which tells `aura upgrade` that
Chocolatey owns the installation.

To verify them:

1. Download the archive and the checksum list of the release:

   https://github.com/johnolafenwa/Aura/releases/download/@TAG@/@ARCHIVE@
   https://github.com/johnolafenwa/Aura/releases/download/@TAG@/SHA256SUMS

2. Check the archive against this checksum, which SHA256SUMS also lists:

   Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256 @ARCHIVE@

   @SHA256@

3. Extract the archive and compare its files with tools\aura, for example:

   Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256 tools\aura\bin\aura.exe

   @AURA_EXE_SHA256@

The GitHub Actions workflow .github/workflows/release.yml of
https://github.com/johnolafenwa/Aura builds both the archive and this
package from the tagged source.
